async function loadProtectionStatus({quiet=false}={}){if(quiet&&protectionBusy)return;if(!quiet){$('#protectionPanel').setAttribute('aria-busy','true')}try{const previous=protectionStatus,data=await readProtectionSession();if(quiet&&protectionBusy)return;protectionStatus=data;protectionCsrf=data.csrf_token||'';if(previous&&!previous.browser_session_active&&data.browser_session_active)resetExpiredView();if(activePage==='access'&&previous?.owner_session_active!==data.owner_session_active)renderClientAccess();if(previous?.browser_session_active&&!data.browser_session_active)clearProtectedView();if(quiet&&protectionRecoveryKey){return}if(quiet&&previous?.storage_enabled===data.storage_enabled&&previous?.access_mode===data.access_mode&&previous?.device_enrolled===data.device_enrolled&&previous?.state===data.state&&previous?.owner_session_active===data.owner_session_active&&previous?.auto_lock_seconds===data.auto_lock_seconds&&previous?.recovery_acknowledgement_status===data.recovery_acknowledgement_status&&previous?.device_error===data.device_error&&JSON.stringify(previous?.exit_recovery)===JSON.stringify(data.exit_recovery)){const remaining=$('#autoLockRemaining');if(remaining)remaining.textContent=protectionAutoLockText(data.auto_lock_remaining_seconds);return}renderProtection()}catch(error){if(isRequestCancelled(error))return;if(isRequestCancelled(error))return;if(isIdentityError(error)&&protectionStatus?.browser_session_active){clearProtectedView();protectionStatus={...protectionStatus,browser_session_active:false,owner_session_active:false};}if(!quiet){$('#protectionState').textContent='无法读取';$('#protectionPanel').innerHTML=protectionShell(`<div class="protection-step"><h3>暂时无法读取保护状态</h3><p>${esc(protectionMessage(error,'请稍后重试'))}</p><button id="retryProtection" class="secondary">重新读取</button></div>`);$('#retryProtection').onclick=()=>loadProtectionStatus()}}}
