    host.innerHTML=`<p class="organize-automation-note">外部 AI 整理的阅读进度见下方来源列表。需要临时整理其他资料时，可手动选择或配置模型接口。</p><details class="continuous-details"><summary>来源检查与整理运行记录</summary><p>${d.policy.enabled?(d.policy.automatic?'已启用限定自动应用策略':'已启用限定任务登记，结果等待审核'):'自动整理未启用'} · 尚未接入推理模型</p><p>内置检查时间：${d.last_checked?esc(formatTime(d.last_checked)):'尚无记录'}。</p>${d.intake_failure?`<p role="alert">${esc(d.intake_failure)}</p>`:''}<button class="copy-button" id="refreshContinuousTasks">刷新任务状态</button>${d.tasks.length?d.tasks.map(t=>`<details><summary>${esc(t.source_path)} · ${esc(labels[t.status]||t.status)}${t.source_current?'':' · 当前依据需重新核对'}</summary><p>来源交付：${Number(t.coverage.source_bytes_delivered)} / ${Number(t.coverage.total_bytes)} 字节。交付完成不代表结论正确。</p><p>最近写入核对：${t.last_verified?esc(formatTime(t.last_verified.at))+'；'+esc(t.last_verified.coverage):'尚无记录'}。仅覆盖列明来源，不代表全部项目资料。</p>${t.failure?`<p>${esc(t.failure)}</p>`:''}${Object.entries(t.targets).map(([path,r])=>`<p>${esc(path)} · ${esc(labels[r.status]||r.status)}${r.failure?'：'+esc(r.failure):''}${r.candidate_id?` <button class="copy-button" data-continuous-candidate="${esc(r.candidate_id)}">查看候选与差异</button>`:''}</p>`).join('')}<details><summary>技术详情</summary><p>来源版本：${esc(t.source_version)}</p><p>任务：${esc(t.task_id)}</p>${Object.values(t.targets).filter(r=>r.version).map(r=>`<p>写入版本：${esc(r.version)}</p>`).join('')}</details></details>`).join(''):'<p>暂无内置持续更新任务。</p>'}</details>`;
